# Issue: a Free query of the instance trie walked a node's branches in
# Data.Map order over Maybe TyCon, which is string-intern order, and the
# fresh type variables that context reduction numbers in that order name
# every later dictionary in the .bo.
# Fix: each trie node keeps and enumerates its keys in first-item order.
# Pull request: https://github.com/MatX-inc/bsc/pull/184
# Probe: TrieOrder's polymorphic module context leaves Free IsModule queries;
# its .bo must dump the same alone and behind TrieOrderScramble (Module first).

batching_bo_pair TrieOrder.bsv TrieOrderRoot.bsv TrieOrderScramble.bsv
